      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انخزق</span></b>  <i>He became pierced</i> [with a spear or
the like]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i> (anything sharp, JK) <i>became stuck</i> into the ground [&amp;c.]. (JK, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اختزق</span></b> , (accord. to different copies
of the K, the latter in the CK,) <i>It</i> (a sword)
<i>became drawn from its scabbard.</i> (K, TA.)

